-- PixelRP: 148 furni whose `furniture` width/length did not match their art.
--
-- The emulator blocks, paths around and draws the Function tool's open-tiles
-- grid from `width`/`length`. These rows came from the original database dump
-- and disagree with BOTH the client's FurnitureData xdim/ydim and the .nitro
-- bundle's logic.model.dimensions, which agree with each other - so the art
-- is the side that is right. (Checked against beta's live gamedata and
-- bundles on 2026-09-25; the 5 furni where those two disagree are left out.)
--
-- Each UPDATE only fires while the row still holds the old size, so a size
-- somebody has since corrected by hand is left alone.

